{
  "id": "benjamin",
  "name": "Benjamin (Rachel's son)",
  "title": "Jacob's youngest son",
  "era": "patriarchs",
  "lifespan": "c. 1900 BC",
  "summary": "Benjamin was the youngest son of Jacob and Rachel, and the only one of Jacob's sons born in the land of Canaan. His birth cost his mother her life, and he was especially loved by his father after Joseph was presumed dead. Benjamin became the ancestor of one of Israel's twelve tribes, which later included King Saul and the apostle Paul.",
